    "actName": "Code of Civil Procedure, 1908",
    "section": "31",
    "heading": "Summons to witnesses",
    "text": "The provisions in sections 27, 28 and 29 shall apply, so far as may be, to summonses to give evidence or to produce documents or other material objects."
